      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-305198",
      ":question/problem": "A charity group is buying $k$ blankets and $m$ jackets for a donation drive. The group needs to purchase more than $60$ items in total, but wants to spend less than $$500$. If each blanket costs $$5$ and each jacket costs $$10$, which of the following systems of inequalities best models this situation?"
